Osmý obchodní den po uvedení na pražskou burzu překročil objem obchodů s WOOD PX ETF hranici 100 milionů korun. První dny obchodování tak přinesly výraznou aktivitu a potvrdily zájem o nový nástroj zaměřený na český akciový trh.</span></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 empty:hidden"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="relative overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 rounded-md" style="aspect-ratio:1"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><img fetchPriority="low" height="2160" width="2160" alt="" class="w-full" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSVjdqFWQAAMiDS?format=webp&amp;name=large" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSVjdqFWQAAMiDS?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSVjdqFWQAAMiDS?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSVjdqFWQAAMiDS?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w"/></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/WOODnCompany/status/2100194968501457343/photo/1"></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="-mx-2 flex h-5 min-h-5 w-[calc(100%+16px)] items-center justify-between overflow-visible @container"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1" data-engagement-action="reply"><a class="x-link disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-70 max-w-full group x-engagement-button transition-colors focus-visible:outline-ring hover:text-blue-500 text-secondary" aria-label="Reply" href="/compose/post?in_reply_to=2100194968501457343"><span class="x-engagement-pill before:bg-blue-500/10 h-9 px-2.5 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-[18px]"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" display="flex" role="img" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-reply-stroke"></use></svg><span class="inline-flex overflow-hidden" style="opacity:1;width:auto;transform:none"><span class="inline-flex tabular-nums text-subtext2 ps-1"><span